    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13842" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποστέρ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>deprivation,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ἀκοῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.70
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἀποστερήσει τοῦ
			δούλου</span> for the purpose of <i>depriving</i> him
			<i>of</i> the slave, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				936d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>withholding what is due,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Antipho Soph.
				107
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.111
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπ᾽ ἀποστερήσει τῶν
			ἐμῶν</span> in order to <i>avoid payment</i> of my claims,
				<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				30.5
			</span></i>.</div>
